    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A length of focusing-lens and witness-glass wound around a heart-coil that never quite decides where its business end is. Strikes register a half-second before and after they happen, which is unsettling for everyone, the wielder included.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Reach 2 squares The head exists in a small superposition: once per turn, if your attack misses, you may reroll it (it turns out it landed in the timeline where it connected). Reach attacks count as melee.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d10 Thermal damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(a strike that lands in several places at once)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Mind</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Channel (Mind)</li>\n  <li><strong>Range:</strong> 10</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T1</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->"
    }
